{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "9.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 30,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Métricas de negocio (Bookings)\n\nMétricas custom emitidas por `booking-service` (`libs/observability` → `getMeter('tickets.booking-service')`). Ver `apps/booking-service/src/bookings.metrics.ts`.\n\n- **`bookings.created`** (Counter) — cantidad de bookings creados, con atributos `event_id`, `status`.\n- **`bookings.total_amount`** (Counter, ARS) — suma monetaria facturada.\n- **`bookings.creation.duration`** (Histogram, ms) — duración end-to-end de crear un booking (incluye la llamada HTTP a `events-service`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bookings creados (15 min)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 31,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(bookings_created_total[15m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Revenue total (15 min) — ARS",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 32,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(bookings_amount_ARS_total[15m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyARS",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 duración creación",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 33,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(bookings_creation_duration_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bookings con error (15 min)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 34,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(bookings_creation_duration_milliseconds_count{status=\"ERROR\"}[15m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bookings creados por minuto (por evento)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 35,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (event_id) (rate(bookings_created_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{event_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Revenue por minuto (ARS)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 36,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(bookings_amount_ARS_total[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "revenue ARS/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyARS",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duración creación booking (p50/p95/p99)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 37,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(bookings_creation_duration_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(bookings_creation_duration_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(bookings_creation_duration_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "tickets",
    "business",
    "bookings"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "Tickets · Bookings (business metrics)",
  "uid": "tickets-bookings-cloud",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
